<div class="rounded-lg bg-container-inset p-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-secondary">
  <p class="font-medium text-primary">Export your history from Trade Republic</p>
  <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1">
    <li>In the Trade Republic app, open your profile, then <span class="text-primary">Documents</span> (or Statements).</li>
    <li>Choose <span class="text-primary">Transaction export</span> and pick the full period, from the day you opened the account until today.</li>
    <li>Upload the CSV file here, keeping the comma separator. Don't open and re-save it in Excel first.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Exporting your whole history matters: holdings are rebuilt from every buy and sell, so a shorter period gives wrong quantities. You never need to share your Trade Republic login with this app.</p>
</div>
